<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchainged at 1.769 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchainged at 1.769 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia remained unchainged at 1.769 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    October 8	    October 7</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.769		  1.769</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $11.72 million	   $11.90 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
